## Command Detection Reference

Scan for these manifest files and extract appropriate commands:

| Manifest | Install | Dev | Test |
|----------|---------|-----|------|
| package.json | npm/yarn/pnpm install | npm run dev | npm test |
| pyproject.toml | poetry install / pip install | python -m app | pytest |
| Cargo.toml | cargo build | cargo run | cargo test |
| go.mod | go mod download | go run . | go test ./... |
| pom.xml | mvn install | mvn spring-boot:run | mvn test |
| Gemfile | bundle install | bundle exec rails s | bundle exec rspec |
| *.csproj | dotnet restore | dotnet run | dotnet test |
| Makefile | make install | make dev | make test |
| docker-compose.yml | docker-compose build | docker-compose up | - |

**Priority:** Extract from actual scripts/targets in manifest when present. Use table values as fallback.

