## Directory Role Detection

Map directories to architectural roles using these patterns:

| Directory Pattern | Role | Description |
|-------------------|------|-------------|
| services/, microservices/ | Backend Services | Microservices, APIs, jobs |
| api/, server/, backend/ | Backend | Main backend app |
| apps/, web/, client/, frontend/, ui/ | Frontend | User-facing apps |
| packages/, libs/, shared/, common/ | Shared Code | Reusable libraries |
| cmd/, bin/ | Entry Points | Executables |
| pkg/, internal/ | Internal Packages | Internal libs |
| infra/, terraform/, k8s/, deploy/ | Infrastructure | IaC and deployment |
| .github/workflows/, .gitlab-ci/, ci/ | CI/CD | Build pipelines |
| db/, prisma/, migrations/, alembic/ | Database | Schema and migrations |
| docs/ | Documentation | Project docs |

**Only include directories that:**
- Actually exist in the project
- Meet adjacency heuristics
- Will have a CLAUDE.md file

