## Cross-Cutting Concern Placement

| Concern | Location | Imported By | Content |
|---------|----------|-------------|---------|
| CI/CD workflows | `.github/CLAUDE.md` | Deployment services, infra/ | Pipeline configs, deploy steps |
| Security policies | `docs/security/CLAUDE.md` | All services/, auth packages | Auth patterns, validation |
| Secret management | `docs/security/SECRETS.md` | Services needing config | Env var retrieval (provider-agnostic) |
| API contracts | `docs/api/CLAUDE.md` | Services exposing/consuming APIs | OpenAPI specs, versioning |
| Database schema | `db/CLAUDE.md` or `prisma/CLAUDE.md` | Services accessing DB | Schema, migrations, queries |
| Observability | `docs/ops/CLAUDE.md` | Production services | Logging, metrics, tracing |
| Performance | `docs/ops/performance.md` | Performance-critical services | Budgets, profiling |
| Resilience | `docs/ops/resilience.md` | External-facing services | Retries, circuit breakers |
| Code style | `docs/STYLE.md` | All code areas (optional) | Linting, formatting rules |
| Domain glossary | `docs/domain/GLOSSARY.md` | Business logic areas | Terminology, invariants |

**Key rule:** Root does NOT import these. Each subtree imports only what it functionally depends on.

