## Functional Dependency Decision Matrix

Determine which cross-cutting concerns to import:

| This area... | Import |
|-------------|--------|
| Exposes REST/GraphQL API | `docs/api/CLAUDE.md` |
| Consumes external APIs | `docs/api/CLAUDE.md` |
| Handles authentication | `docs/security/CLAUDE.md` |
| Performs authorization | `docs/security/CLAUDE.md` |
| Accesses database | `db/CLAUDE.md` or `prisma/CLAUDE.md` |
| Is production service | `docs/ops/CLAUDE.md` (observability) |
| Calls external services | `docs/ops/resilience.md` |
| Has performance requirements | `docs/ops/performance.md` |
| Uses secrets/config | `docs/security/SECRETS.md` |

